{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1505","id":4019630809,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87vlrLZ","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1505","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1505.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1505.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1505","number":1505,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat: promote QA-passed MS assets to post-attempt display posture (#1492)","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Promotes only the controlled page-level MS screenshots that passed #1491's Codex worker visual QA into post-attempt self-assessment display eligibility, and records the product display receipt that gates it.\n\n## Two axes, never collapsed\n\n`product_display_policy_posture` says what the product will show and where. `legal_authorization_status` says what we can prove about the source. `product_allowed_with_takedown` is not a licence.\n\nNo artifact in this repository establishes a licence or explicit permission for the 9709 mark schemes, so `licensed` and `explicit_permission` stay unwritable. 413 assets sit at `rights_unknown`; the 11 pages whose source carries a third-party redistribution band declaring the questions modified are `rights_blocked`.\n\n| Product posture | Count | | Legal status | Count |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `product_allowed_with_takedown` | 25 | | `licensed` | 0 |\n| `internal_only` | 382 | | `explicit_permission` | 0 |\n| `temporarily_disabled` | 0 | | `public_source_unlicensed` | 0 |\n| `blocked` | 17 | | `rights_unknown` | 413 |\n| | | | `rights_blocked` | 11 |\n\n## Release scope is conservative by default\n\nBecause nothing is legally authorized, promotion lands in a closed scope: `internal_only`, `requires_login: true`, `public_indexing_allowed: false`. `public_launch` is `future_authorization_required`. The validator fails if any public scope is granted without an authorization artifact, if indexing is enabled anywhere, if a closed scope drops login, or if an eligible asset has no release scope.\n\n## What gets promoted\n\nAn asset reaches a student only when it carries `visual_qa_pass` **and** the row it is revealed for carries `row_page_match_pass`. That yields 25 eligible page assets across 6 documents and **28 allowed source reveals**, each with a disable switch and a takedown handle.\n\nA clean render whose locator was never verified against its question row is `internal_only`, not `blocked` — the pixels are fine, the aim is unproven. That is where the other 382 QA-passed assets sit.\n\n## What stays hidden\n\n6 wrong-page front-matter renders, the 11 watermarked pages, and the 2895 document-only / ambiguous / manual-review rows. The 607 page rows that failed promotion fall back to the structured explanation rather than revealing a source page. Nothing is visible pre-attempt. 11 of the 28 allowed reveals share a page with a neighbouring question's answers and keep their exposure warning.\n\n## Reconciliation with #1458\n\n#1458 recorded `blocked` for these assets on the basis that no student-display legal authorization artifact exists. That basis still holds, and it is why the scope here is closed: nothing becomes publicly visible and the legal field is untouched. Widening past a closed scope re-enters that blocker. The reconciliation is recorded in the artifact rather than left implicit.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm run method-map:build-post-attempt-ms-source-reveal-product-display-posture` → `validation_status: pass`, 25/25 checks, byte-identical on rerun.\n- 36 new unit tests; the #1491 suite still passes (68 total).\n- Preflight `report_artifact_guard` and A+ ratchet both healthy.\n\n`official_authorization_claimed_count`, `automatic_scoring_claim_count` and `smart_mark_readiness_claim_count` are all 0. No screenshots, no crops, no OCR, no VLM, no external model call, no production writes.\n\nCloses #1492\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","created_at":"2026-07-09T05:47:22Z","updated_at":"2026-07-09T05:52:00Z","closed_at":"2026-07-09T05:52:00Z","merged_at":"2026-07-09T05:52:00Z","merge_commit_sha":"4ed58344f9c73e4c6cd30d216bf6b1c0d3f952d5","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1505/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1505/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1505/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/a1b4bad8de2f12f63bfe35b21d210c26cea0badd","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1492","ref":"feat/issue-1492","sha":"a1b4bad8de2f12f63bfe35b21d210c26cea0badd","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url"